{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43647","headline":"送昼公联句 · 清昼","name":"送昼公联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相逢情不厌，惜别意难爲。\n吾道应无住，前期未可知。\n轻霜凋古木，寒水缩荒陂。\n宾雁依沙屿，浮云惨路岐。\n林疎看野迥，岸转觉山移。\n寄赏惊摇落，归心叹别离。\n草堂思偃蹇，麈尾去相随。\n勿谓光阴远，禅房会一窥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}